===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*Heh₃l-|*bʰewgʰ-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|elbowe}}, from {{inh|en|ang|elboga}}, {{m|ang|elnboga||elbow}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*alinabugô||elbow}}, equivalent to {{compound|en|ell|bow|nocat=1}}. Cognate with {{cog|sco|elbuck||elbow}}, {{cog|stq|Älbooge||elbow}}, {{cog|nl|elleboog||elbow}}, {{cog|nds|Ellebage||elbow}}, {{cog|de|Ellbogen}}, {{m|de|Ellenbogen||elbow}}, {{cog|da|albue||elbow}}, {{cog|is|olbogi}}, {{m|is|olnbogi||elbow}}.

